// 1-2: the blue lens (a bridge, then a hop up a wall too tall to jump), then pull up two cliffs.
id l1-02
name 1-2 HANDSHAKE
tagline syn. syn-ack. ack. now climb.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main pull blue
mechanics pull:2 blue:2
new pull blue
portion 2 pull ports up the shaft
portion 2 blue ledges across the chimney
hardness 2
