text YELLOW PORTS PULL *YOU*. AIM UP AT IT, TAP {jack}.\nIT REELS YOU IN. JUMP AT THE TOP.\nTWO CLIFFS. SAME TRICK TWICE.
text NO FLOOR AHEAD. EXCEPT IN BLUE.\nINSIDE A BLUE ZONE, BLUE FLOORS ARE REAL.\nWALK ACROSS. THEN HOP UP THE BLUE LEDGE. || NO FLOOR AHEAD. EXCEPT IN BLUE.\nHOLD {recal} AND THE BLUE FLOORS ARE REAL.\nWALK ACROSS. THEN HOP UP THE BLUE LEDGE. THE LENS LASTS ABOUT 5 SECONDS.
